### ℹ️ INFO — S1-05 (Positive Finding): Receipt Totals Are Recomputed Server-Side

**File:** `lib/firebase_service.dart` (L1551–1590)  
The `submitReceipt()` function completely ignores `grandTotal` passed from the client and recomputes it from line items:
```dart
// "never trust client-aggregated totals"
final computedGrand = computedServicesSub + computedPartsSub;
```
This is an excellent pattern that prevents billing manipulation by a rogue technician client.

