### ℹ️ INFO — S1-06 (Positive Finding): Payment Amount Validated Before Write

**File:** `lib/firebase_service.dart` (L1106–1112)  
`submitTechnicianPayment()` validates `isFinite`, `> 0`, and `<= 50000` before any Firestore write. Good defensive coding.

