### ℹ️ INFO — B4-07 (Positive Finding): Stats Updates Use `FieldValue.increment`

All counter updates use `FieldValue.increment` in a `SetOptions(merge: true)` write. This is the correct Firebase-recommended pattern for maintaining aggregate counters without read-modify-write cycles.

