### ℹ️ INFO — B4-08 (Positive Finding): All Queries Are Bounded With `.limit()`

Every `collection()` query in `firebase_service.dart` includes an explicit `.limit()` call. This prevents runaway reads on large datasets. The limits are reasonable (20–100 for lists, 1 for singletons).

